Package: codytools
Title: Personal Plotting, Website and Stan Tools
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Cody", "VanZandt", email = "cody.a.vanzandt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A warm literary ggplot2 theme, helpers for sending plots from analysis
    projects to posts on a Quarto website and publishing it, and a small Stan workflow
    (cached fitting, sampler checks, summaries and rank plots).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 4.0.0), grid, gtable, rlang, scales (>= 1.4.0), systemfonts, tools, utils
Suggests: bayesplot, cmdstanr, ggdist, knitr, posterior, ragg, tidybayes
Additional_repositories: https://stan-dev.r-universe.dev
